<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets call on China Dev Corp.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets call on China Dev Corp.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Friday it has issued 20 million American style call warrants on shares of China Development Corp.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$3.8993    PREMIUM	   18.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$0.7213    GEARING	   5.4X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  23.FEB.98    MIN EXER LOT    1,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG   SETTLEMENT	CASH ONLY</p>
<p> SPOT PRICE	  US$3.8993</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
